# Sample CAD drawings for the legacy-import work (Task 11).
#
# Generated fixtures are not committed -- they are rebuilt from the test
# builders, and DWG is a large binary format:
#
#   docker compose run --rm engine python tests/cad_import_test.py
#
# Real legacy drawings from testers are the fixtures that matter, and they may
# carry client data, so they are kept out of the repository too. Drop them in
# here locally; the compose file mounts this directory at /fixtures.
*.dwg
*.dxf
